{"strongs": "H6098", "word": "עֵצָה", "translit": "e.tsah", "root": "יעף", "morph": "H:N-F", "pos": "noun feminine", "gloss": "counsel, advice", "definition": "עֵצָה noun feminine counsel, advice (= (יְ)עֵצָה ) — ׳ ע Judg 20:7 + 28 t.; construct עֲצַת Isa 5:19 + 33 t.; suffix עֲצָתִי Prov 1:25 + 5 t. (+ Isa 46:11 Qr ; Kt עצתו better); עֲצָֽתְךָ Ps 20:5 ; Ps 73:24 עֲצָתוֺ Hos 10:6 + 7 t. (including Isa 46:10 Kt see supr); עֲצָתָם Jer 18:23 + 4 t.; plural עֵצוֺת Deut 32:28 + 2 t.; עֲצָתָ֑יִךְ Isa 47:13 — counsel, advice 2Sam 15:31 ; 2Sam 15:34 ; 2Sam 16:23 (twice in verse); 2Sam 17:14 (3 t. in verse); 2Sam 17:23 ; 1Kgs 12:8 ; 1Kgs 12:13 ; 1Kgs 12:14 = 2Chr 10:8 ; 2Chr 10:13 ; 2Chr 25:16 ; Ezra 10:3 (where read אֲדֹנִי ׳ ע Reuss Ry ), v Ezra 10:8 ; Job 29:21 political consultation Isa 47:13 as accusative of congnate meaning with verb 2Sam 17:7 ; 1Kgs 1:12 ; Isa 8:10 ; Ezek 11:2 ( עצתרָֿע , || אָוֶן ); with הָב֫וּ give counsel Judg 20:7 ; 2Sam 16:20 ׳ חֵבִיא ע Isa 16:3 ׳ עשׂה ע Isa 30:1 אָשִׁית עֵצוֺת בְּנַפְשִׁי Ps 13:3 = design, purpose Ezra 4:5 ; Neh 4:9 ; 1Chr 12:20 ( Baer ), Ps 14:6 ; Ps 20:5 ; Jer 18:23 (followed by עַל = against ), Jer 49:30 (|| מַחֲשָׁבָה ); עֲצַתגּֿוֺיִם Ps 33:10 suitable counsel for war (= generalship) 2Kgs 18:20 = Isa 36:5 (compare Prov 20:18 below); also עֲצַת שָׁלוֺם Zech 6:13 counsel of peace ; practical wisdom, sagacity Isa 19:3 , compare v Isa 19:11 , Jer 19:7 ; Deut 32:28 (|| תְּבוּנָה ), Hos 10:6 . Especially in Wisdom Literature and prophets; counsel = good counsle, wisdom Job 38:2 ; Job 42:3 ; Prov 12:15 ; Prov 20:5 (its seat בְּלֶבאִֿישׁ ); || תּוּשִׁיָּה Prov 8:14 ; Isa 28:29 (of ׳ י ); || חָכְמָה Jer 49:7 || חָכְמָה and תְּבוּנָה Job 12:13 ; Prov 21:30 || מוּסָר Prov 19:20 || תַּחְבֻּלוֺת Prov 20:18 (compare Isa 36:5 above); נִפְתָּלִים ׳ ע Job 5:13 וּגְבוּרָה ׳ רוּחַ ע Isa 11:2 (|| חָכְמָה וּבָינָה ׳ ר ); hearty counsel נֶפֶשׁ ׳ ע Prov 27:9 counsel of wisdom , when wisdom is personified Prov 1:25 ; Prov 1:30 (|| תּוֺכַחַת ); in bad sense רשׁעים ׳ ע Job 10:3 ; Job 21:16 ; Job 22:18 ; Ps 1:1 , compare Job 18:7 ; Ps 106:43 ; Isa 29:15 of plan of ׳ י ; ׳ י ׳ ע Ps 33:11 ; Prov 19:21 ; Isa 19:17 ; Isa 14:26 ( הַיִעוּצָה ׳ הע ), Isa 25:1 ; Isa 46:10 ; Isa 46:11 קדושׁ ישׂראל ׳ ע Isa 5:19 also Mic 4:12 ; Jer 32:19 ( גְּדֹל הָעֵצָה ), Jer 49:20 ; Jer 50:45 ; Ps 106:13 עֶלְיוֺן ׳ ע Ps 107:11 instruction, guiding wisdom of ׳ י Ps 73:24 אִישׁעֲֿצָתוֺ i.e. counsellor of ׳ י Isa 40:13 in figure אַנְשֵׁי עֲצָתִי Ps 119:24 = my counsellors , said of testimonies of God; = prophecy , מלאכיו ׳ ע Isa 44:26 (|| דְּבַר עַבְדּוֺ ); מִזְּקֵנִים ׳ תִּאֹבַד ע Ezek 7:26 (compare 1Kgs 12:8 || חָזוֺן , תּוֺרָה ), מֵחָכָם Jer 18:18 (|| דָּבָר , תּוֺרָה ).", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3637')\">BDB3637</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H6098')\">H6098</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3636')\">BDB3636</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3638')\">BDB3638</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>עֵצָה</bdbheb> <b>noun feminine</b> <highlightword>counsel, advice</highlightword> (= <bdbheb>(יְ)עֵצָה</bdbheb>) — <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ע</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Judg 20:7\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(7,20,7)\">Judg 20:7</ref> + 28 t.; construct <bdbheb>עֲצַת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 5:19\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(23,5,19)\">Isa 5:19</ref> + 33 t.; suffix <bdbheb>עֲצָתִי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 1:25\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(20,1,25)\">Prov 1:25</ref> + 5 t. (+ <ref ref=\"Isa 46:11\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"46\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"46\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(23,46,11)\">Isa 46:11</ref> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Qr')\"><reflink>Qr</reflink></lookup>; <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Kt')\"><reflink>Kt</reflink></lookup> <bdbheb>עצתו</bdbheb> better); <bdbheb>עֲצָֽתְךָ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 20:5\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(19,20,5)\">Ps 20:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 73:24\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"73\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"73\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(19,73,24)\">Ps 73:24</ref> <bdbheb>עֲצָתוֺ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Hos 10:6\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(28,10,6)\">Hos 10:6</ref> + 7 t. (including <ref ref=\"Isa 46:10\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"46\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"46\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(23,46,10)\">Isa 46:10</ref> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Kt')\"><reflink>Kt</reflink></lookup> see supr); <bdbheb>עֲצָתָם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 18:23\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(24,18,23)\">Jer 18:23</ref> + 4 t.; plural <bdbheb>עֵצוֺת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 32:28\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(5,32,28)\">Deut 32:28</ref> + 2 t.; <bdbheb>עֲצָתָ֑יִךְ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 47:13\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"47\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"47\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(23,47,13)\">Isa 47:13</ref> — <highlight>counsel, advice</highlight> <ref ref=\"2Sam 15:31\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"31\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"31\" onclick=\"bcv(10,15,31)\">2Sam 15:31</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Sam 15:34\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"34\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"34\" onclick=\"bcv(10,15,34)\">2Sam 15:34</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Sam 16:23\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(10,16,23)\">2Sam 16:23</ref> (twice in verse); <ref ref=\"2Sam 17:14\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(10,17,14)\">2Sam 17:14</ref> (3 t. in verse); <ref ref=\"2Sam 17:23\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(10,17,23)\">2Sam 17:23</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 12:8\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(11,12,8)\">1Kgs 12:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 12:13\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(11,12,13)\">1Kgs 12:13</ref>; <ref ref=\